      "title": "BREP Asia III India Holding Co II Pte. Ltd. entered into a Securities Subscription and Purchase Agreement to acquire Visco Advisory Private Limited from GAMCO Limited (BSE:540097).",
      "body": "BREP Asia III India Holding Co II Pte. Ltd. entered into a Securities Subscription and Purchase Agreement to acquire Visco Advisory Private Limited from GAMCO Limited (BSE:540097) on March 26, 2026. As part of the acquisition, BREP Asia III India Holding Co II Pte. Ltd. will acquire entire stake in Visco Advisory Private Limited. The consideration for the transaction has been agreed between the parties, however, GAMCO Limited shall make appropriate disclosure on completion. Upon completion, Visco Advisory Private Limited shall cease to be a wholly owned subsidiary and consequently shall cease to be a subsidiary of GAMCO Limited. For the period ending March 31, 2025, Visco Advisory Private Limited reported total revenue of INR 0 and net worth of INR 0.92 million.\n\nThe transaction is subject",
